## How to file

You can file this application online at rtionline.gov.in: choose Employees' Provident Fund Organisation as the public authority, paste section 3 as the text of the request and pay the Rs 10 fee online. Or send this printed letter by post with the fee. The CPIO must reply within 30 days (Section 7). If there is no reply, or the reply is not satisfactory, you can file a first appeal within 30 days (Section 19).
